{*******************************************************************************
*                                                                              *
*                               SYMBOL MODULE                                  *
*                                                                              *
*                             9/89 S. A. Moore                                 *
*                                                                              *
* Handles construction of the symbol table, as well as its output to the       *
* intermediate file. Also handles the type structures, their construction,     *
* output to the intermediate, and several parser support functions that have   *
* to do with type structures. In this parser, virtually all program constructs *
* are build with type entries.                                                 *
*                                                                              *
*******************************************************************************}

